## 2. Users & Market

### Primary Persona — “Priya, First-Time Technical Founder”

- **Stage:** pre-seed to seed, Delaware C-corp
- **Round:** raising $500K–$3M on SAFEs, possibly with 1–2 notes
- **Company shape:** 1–3 cofounders, 0–3 hires, 0–2 advisor grants
- **Current tools:** Excel/Sheets or Carta’s free Launch tier (capped at 25 stakeholders)
- **Technical comfort:** Can run `docker compose up`, reads Prisma, writes code
- **Primary JTBD:** *“Before I sign a SAFE or close a priced round, show me exactly how ownership moves under different terms so I can negotiate and not be surprised.”*
- **Secondary JTBD:** *“Give me a defensible cap table artifact I can hand to my next investor’s lawyer.”*
- **Top frustrations:**
1. Excel silently breaks once 3+ SAFEs stack (circular-reference bugs, post-money denominator mistakes)
1. Carta’s free tier doesn’t include scenario modeling; it’s gated at ~$3K+/yr
1. Pulley has modeling on free but caps stakeholders, breaks at Series A
1. Lawyer fees for “model this SAFE” cost more than the software would

### Secondary Persona — “Sam, Non-Technical Founder”

- Same fundraising profile, but can’t run Docker
- Needs a one-click deploy button (Railway, Render, Fly.io) or a hosted community demo instance
- Willing to trade self-hosting for a free hosted tier hosted by the project (community edition)

### Tertiary Personas (build for Priya first, these benefit automatically)

- **Fractional CFO** serving 3–10 portfolio companies (one self-host, many orgs)
- **Accelerator program director** (YC, Techstars, boutique) baking it into cohort curriculum
- **Angel syndicate lead** modeling dilution across a portfolio of 20–30 checks
- **Startup lawyer** doing quick-and-dirty modeling without billing engineering

### Market

Non-revenue project. YC’s active portfolio is the rough proxy (~5,000 companies cumulative, ~400 new/year). Combined with non-YC seed-stage US C-corps (~50K–100K at any given moment, per Crunchbase-adjacent estimates — unvalidated), cost-conscious subset ~30–50%, reachable in year 1 via GitHub + HackerNews + accelerator partnerships.

### Competitive Positioning

|Tool                            |Free tier       |Scenario modeling     |Self-host |Math transparency  |Our edge                                                     |
|--------------------------------|----------------|----------------------|----------|-------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------|
|Carta                           |≤25 stakeholders|Paid tiers only       |No        |Black-box          |Free scenario modeler + self-host + transparent math         |
|Pulley                          |Up to Series A  |Yes, gated later      |No        |Partial            |No gating, you own the data                                  |
|AngelList Stack                 |AL-linked only  |Limited               |No        |Black-box          |Works outside AL, supports arbitrary instruments             |
|Excel/Sheets                    |Forever         |Hand-rolled           |Trivially |Forced transparency|Correctness on stacked SAFEs, audit trail, no broken formulas|
