## 4. Goals & Non-Goals

### Goals

1. **Correctness-first.** Every calculation reproduces a known-good reference to the cent. Correctness ships ahead of features.
1. **Transparency.** Every result exposes its formula, inputs, and intermediate values. No black-box numbers.
1. **Editability.** Every assumption that materially affects output is editable in the UI — no hidden defaults.
1. **Interop.** OCF in, OCF out. CSV in, CSV out. Zero lock-in.
1. **Two deploy paths.** Technical founders `docker compose up`. Non-technical founders click a button.
1. **Agent-buildable.** Every component has a deterministic spec an AI coding agent can implement without judgment calls.

### Non-Goals

- Performance at scale (target: single-tenant, <1000 stakeholders per company)
- Real-time multi-user collaboration
- Offline / PWA support
- Mobile-responsive beyond “works on tablet”
- i18n in v1.0 (English only; structure must not block future locales)

