## 10. UI / UX Requirements

### 10.1 Layout Conventions

- shadcn/ui components for every primitive
- Tailwind utility classes, no custom CSS unless necessary
- Sticky-header tables via TanStack Table
- Recharts for any visual (ownership pie, before/after bar)
