### 10.2 Scenario Builder Layout

Two-pane:

- **Left:** scenario assumptions form (collapsible advanced sections)
- **Right:** live results preview (debounced 300ms on input changes)

### 10.3 Results Page Requirements

Every scenario results page must include, in order:

1. Summary cards (pre-money, new money, pps, total SAFE/note conversion, pool top-up, post-money FD)
1. Ownership tables (before → after conversion → after pool → final)
1. Convertible detail panels (one per SAFE and note, showing cap price, discount price, selected price, conversion amount, shares issued, “why cap won” text)
1. Formula explanation section (all formulas from §9 in readable form with live values substituted)
1. Warnings panel (M5)
1. Export buttons (CSV ownership, CSV conversions, JSON full scenario + result)

### 10.4 Advanced Mode Toggle

Global setting. When OFF, hides: capDenominatorShares override, preMoneyDenominatorShares override, conversionOrderingRule, MFN fallback.

### 10.5 Autosave

Scenario drafts autosave to localStorage every 2 seconds during editing; warning banner if unsaved changes on navigation.

