## 11. Validation Rules

### Hard (block submit)

- Share counts ≥ 0
- Money fields ≥ 0
- Percentages 0–100
- Maturity date ≥ issue date
- Compound interest requires `compoundingFrequencyPerYear`
- Cap-only SAFE: discount must be null
- Discount-only SAFE: cap must be null
- Fixed-equity template: `equityPercent` required

### Soft (warning only — do not block)

- Authorized shares exceeded in scenario
- Unresolved MFN SAFEs in scenario
- Round assumptions inconsistent (e.g. pre-money + new money produces pps ≤ 0)
- Post-money ownership >100% (indicates malformed settings)
- Note past maturity date

