## 20. Human Review Loop (explicit)

This project is built by AI coding agents. That shifts — but doesn’t remove — human responsibility. **Asad owns:**

1. Problem-statement alignment — does the spec still describe the actual user need?
1. Acceptance-criteria review on every PR before merge
1. Golden-file test authoring — the numbers the agents are matching against
1. Bug triage — deciding whether a reported wrong number is a math bug or a known limitation
1. Release sign-off — the “ship it” decision, regardless of CI green

The PRD is the human-loop artifact. Changes to this PRD require explicit edit, not inference by agents.

